We establish a two-tier token hierarchy adhering to WCAG 2.1 AA (4.5:1 text, 3:1 non-text UI elements). High-luminance fallbacks (`--brand-200`/`--brand-300`) are mapped in dark contexts to guarantee compliant contrast against dark surfaces (`--surface-base: #0f172a` / `#121212`).

